{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "99ea7e26e68ce471b328650ffca7f2110939303ad1846eae9a287b13cb0fcc70", "ja": "開演☆ファン感謝祭♪", "zh": "开演☆粉丝感谢祭♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "16788998ccf182256acf68b8e2985bd478e7e93c2540062d5820d20655104bbb", "ja": "『トゥインクルリズム』のファン向け感謝祭\nが開催！　司会を務める春香に続いて、育、\n百合子、亜利沙が登場、会場は出だしから大\n盛り上がり！　魔法のカメラで記念撮影をし\nたら、イベントスタート♪", "zh": "『トゥインクルリズム』粉丝答谢祭\n开幕！继担任主持人的春香之后，育、\n百合子和亚利沙也登场，会场从一开始就\n热闹非凡！用魔法相机拍下纪念照后，\n活动正式开始♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "832f9a4ba3938aa98abe4abb0cc424f699768e04481069a7db072afb4d494e2c", "ja": "よい子のみんなー！　こんにちはー！\n『魔法少女トゥインクルリズム』の世界へようこそ！", "zh": "乖孩子们——！你们好呀——！\n欢迎来到《魔法少女闪耀节奏》的世界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "90e35fedd87b72dcf101c9609a675e2f11fa51a6a87158462df7347b4240a7d5", "ja": "私は、天海春香っていいます。妖精のぴーちゃんの\nお友達なの。私もトゥインクルリズムが大好きなんだ！", "zh": "我叫天海春香，是小精灵小P的朋友。我也最喜欢《魔法少女闪耀节奏》了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1002_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "ebe8719797ba381dc781d6dfd7da02b5d5ad857da965c4837f30a6b2204f96b7", "ja": "わあああああっ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "3cfab705615579268b2db69744c1178e4388206021809b32dfec2fb28a547e7b", "ja": "みんな、元気いっぱいだね！　ふふっ。\n今日は最後までよろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "大家真是精神十足呢！呵呵。\n今天也请多关照到最后哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "1e52b3fdc12ab853d7f45f496b33e92cf01cff9e73badca2f6895afad397eed7", "ja": "それじゃ、トゥインクルリズムの3人を呼んでみよう！\nみんなも大きな声で名前を呼んでね。……せーの！", "zh": "那么，来呼唤闪耀节奏的3位成员吧！\n大家也要大声喊出她们的名字哦。……预备——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
