{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "5206001d5832ad8a7e55516b2457039cad224c5208a1b6642b7e964461770923", "ja": "まずは、みんなからご挨拶です。\n百合子ちゃん、お願いします。", "zh": "首先，请大家先和各位打个招呼。\n百合子，拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "fe9e5d4c59b41f4088f5069c5d12abf0c2143441d93b2e0bb572f96a3a73b195", "ja": "はい！　……会場のみんな、こんにちはー！\nトゥインクルリリーの七尾百合子です♪", "zh": "好的！……现场的各位，大家好——！\n我是Twinkle Lily的七尾百合子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "9e956b2027d21429676c647c05268bed637b33aa36ff9def6cc6d07a8f97d4fc", "ja": "私達に会いに来てくれて、ありがとうございます！\n最後まで楽しんでいってくださいね。", "zh": "谢谢大家特地来看我们！请一直开心地看到最后哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "c85eb51e62a435c53a61b82614f943467ab19ecf0778ff235433b2192d129ccd", "ja": "トゥインクルアリサこと、松田亜利沙ですっ！\nみんなの元気な声、バッチリいただきました～！", "zh": "闪耀亚利沙，也就是松田亚利沙！\n大家活力满满的声音，我已经完美收到了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "66b8c463e06fa09dae84828004937bb3138d5c713435a3b6e71f68347cb300b0", "ja": "でもでも！　元気ならありさだって負けませんよ～。\nこの後のコーナーも盛り上げるために……。", "zh": "但是但是！要比精神头的话，亚利沙也不会输哦～  \n为了让接下来的环节也热闹起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1023_030iku", "source_sha256": "0b457eff2e234ab77019981564672ae3868d254732ed493ee39f6a4ddba2fd34", "ja": "亜利沙さん！　『あいさつは短く』するんだよね？\n……時間は大丈夫？", "zh": "亚利沙姐姐！要“简短地打招呼”，对吧？\n……时间还来得及吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "b0a34f363d74a31d8b082d9fdd7f9b7a5b21dd735df82e9615581f8d763cba99", "ja": "ハッ、そうでした！　えっと……ありさの挨拶は\nこれくらいにして。次は育ちゃん、どうぞ！", "zh": "啊，对了！那个……亚利沙的致辞就到这里。接下来请小育来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "bb0004246066f0e5a4beaa2dca4703cff772648cd603ad6e1eeceb6e8c535abc", "ja": "ありがとう、亜利沙さん。……みんな、お待たせ～！\nトゥインクルプリンセスの中谷育です。", "zh": "谢谢亚利沙小姐。……让大家久等啦～！\n我是闪耀公主的中谷育。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1026_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "c80c292b19457114603af534e2b407a66e33c90bfbfd73ff105b280019b863a1", "ja": "わあああああ～っ！！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊～！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "d364f01d9a81b6d5a060e70a0e88ba56b1b25b2fc99fbde021a73477f1c059c1", "ja": "わあ～、すごい声！　うれしいな～。\n今日はわたし達と一緒に、楽しい思い出にしようね♪", "zh": "哇～，好大的欢呼声！真开心呀～。\n今天就和我们一起，留下快乐的回忆吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1028_se", "source_sha256": "028462f1dfdd9d24259ded91cbe4a60e605838a01af2295e7ad5a8594ce60544", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ……！", "zh": "（掌声如雷）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "32d8d211e1edf65728d5d175762806cbeb7582be3d2ee2342cc8f931ab578244", "ja": "ありがとうございました。ねえ、育ちゃん？\nみんなにお願いがあるって聞いたんだけど……。", "zh": "谢谢大家。对了，小育？\n听说你有件事想拜托大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "e027bf1d5ab352eca538c236351a6e13a552a039aee21a7ee1946e3e6e218346", "ja": "うん。あのね、わたし達が魔法少女だってこと、\n他の人にはナイショにしててほしいんだ。", "zh": "嗯。那个呀，我们是魔法少女这件事，\n希望能对其他人保密哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "997a6a8c44aa0c1d858f944cc2e33df7e99192929681b3aeeac66a5e1e16c717", "ja": "わたし達とみんなとの秘密だよ。\nみんな、約束してくれるかな～？", "zh": "这是我们和大家之间的秘密哦。\n大家能答应我吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1032_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "53d48977ce08f39eeac5afad301b8b971c77666c9f20e3d41171016e0798db10", "ja": "はーーい！！", "zh": "来——了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "a49f125e7fcaa72b40c055705e5ccd2581a3bfc964f093a1c407b4d6b2f8aec9", "ja": "みんな、返事もバッチリだね！　さて、これから\n亜利沙ちゃんが、みんなに魔法をかけてくれます！", "zh": "大家的回答也都很响亮呢！那么，接下来\n亚利沙要为大家施展魔法了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0196_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_01_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "bbc97fb7e2df3c6452a2a187c9f1e578ee9e50cd5457d8333ff1bbd43c228f25", "ja": "はい！　会場のみんなと記念撮影をしたいなーって。\nカメラもちゃんと持ってきちゃいました！", "zh": "好的！我想和现场的大家一起拍张纪念照来着。相机也好好带来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
